# Build-only: the libraries Blender 5.3.0 links, each a package at the version
# Blender pins (build_files/build_environment/cmake/versions.cmake there).
# - Blender's own: Imath, OpenEXR (over libdeflate and OpenJPH), OpenColorIO
#   (over yaml-cpp, pystring and minizip-ng), OpenImageIO (over pugixml and
#   robin-map) with its programs, which its CMake package checks are there,
#   oneTBB, Eigen and libepoxy. OpenEXR, OpenColorIO, OpenImageIO and oneTBB
#   are compiled with -pthread, as Blender is: OpenEXR's call_once links only so.
# - FreeType with Brotli (Blender's fonts are WOFF2), libjpeg-turbo (Blender
#   takes libjpeg's boolean as an integer, which it is there), libtiff, expat,
#   {fmt}, and Python with libpython and what a program that embeds it links.
# - ccfilter runs the compiler without the options upstream passes to every
#   Clang and Dolly's cc refuses; binaryen is for Blender's link
#   (Dollyfile-blender).
